    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about \"small steps\" though. the numbers don't lie. i look at them and i just see a wall. no matter how hard i work or how much i cut back, i'm just moving in circles. it feels like i'm just prolonging something that's already broken. there's no real end to it, just more of the same misery. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop.",
